@startuml Convoy Lifecycle

title Convoy lifecycle
caption Target design. Convoy operations. Decisions O36, P4, O3, O10, O25. ADRs 0001, 0008, 0015.

state "Planning" as Planning {
  state "Truck list open" as Open : route, crew, leader, budget,\nequipment, insurance, bookings
  state "Truck list published" as Published : no vehicle may join;\nmanifests may be proposed
  [*] --> Open
  Open --> Published : publish truck list
}

state "Departed" as Departed : on the road; marks, crossings,\nfuel and outcomes recorded
state "Arrived" as Arrived : every travelling vehicle delivered;\ndelivered vehicles handed over
state "Closed" as Closed : closing report generated;\nnot locked (O25)

[*] --> Planning : create convoy
Planning --> [*] : deleted before departure
Published --> Departed : Dispatcher departs\n[every blocking requirement holds]
Published --> Published : depart refused (409)\nlists what is missing
Departed --> Arrived : Dispatcher marks arrived\n[no vehicle still travelling]
Arrived --> Closed : Dispatcher closes
Closed --> Closed : correction;\nreport regenerated

note right of Published
  No override, waiver or "depart anyway" (O3).
  A vehicle may still be withdrawn after publication.
end note

@enduml
